<title>SWITZERLAND: Usego says on track to double 1997 profit.</title>
<headline>Usego says on track to double 1997 profit.</headline>
<dateline>VOLKETSWIL, Switzerland 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss food company Usego Hofer Curti (UHC) reiterated its forecast that it could double group profit in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;UHC is on course regarding the goal set at the start of 1997 to double profit,&quot; it said in a statement. &quot;The outlook for the second half is good.&quot;</p>
<p>It gave no profit figures for the first half, when group sales rose 1.4 percent from the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>UHC posted 1996 pre-tax profit of 10.7 million Swiss francs and attributable net profit of 5.1 million</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
